Subject: [Buildroot] [git commit] support/dependencies: ensure we have
	'file' on the host
Message-ID: <20161227170656.1313E81E49@busybox.osuosl.org>
List-Id: <buildroot.busybox.net>
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset="us-ascii"
